%% Phase4 / timeline / G-11 已缓存消息定位
%% Helix owners: query/local_first.rs; port_reply/dispatch_read.rs; event/timeline.rs
%% Cached locate is local-only; the consumer performs scrolling after the correlated result.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as PC Angular UI
  participant Gate as messageV3ImGate
  participant Native as Tauri/Native
  participant FFI as Mobile FFI
  participant Web as Browser/Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell/Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Sink as EventSink/adapter

  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: queryMessages(locate postId)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_locate_message", {postId,req_id})
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Mobile FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_locate_message", payload)
  else Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_locate_message", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: validate postId/channel scope and locate correlation
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist Scan local message index
  Host->>DB: lookup postId in tenant-local bounded cache
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(hit, surrounding rows, older/newer tokens)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(hit)
  alt cached hit
    IM->>Host: Persist ScopedGet located window
    Host->>DB: readback ordered bounded window
    DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
    Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
    IM->>Sink: Emit im:timeline:located(postId,window,tokens)
    Sink-->>UI: Native bus → resolve locate waiter；UI scrolls to postId
    Sink-->>FFI: batch raw located event bytes
    Sink-->>Web: EventBatch raw located event bytes
  else miss or scope mismatch
    IM->>Sink: Emit correlated failed locate/read result
  end
  Note over UI,Web: renderer 执行滚动，不由 Helix 发布 activate-window/Surface 指令；cached locate 不应制造 HTTP。
